-tight text-gray-950 leading-[1.1] md:text-5xl lg:text-[56px]"> Sık  <br> sorulan  <br> sorular </h2> </div> <div class="flex-1 divide-y divide-gray-200 border-y border-gray-200"> <details class="group py-5 sm:py-8" open> <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"> <span class="text-[16px] sm:text-[19px] font-bold text-gray-900"> Bu Gemini filigran kaldırıcı tamamen ücretsiz mi? </span> <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg transition-colors bg-gray-100 text-gray-400 group-open:bg-gray-950 group-open:text-white"> <svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-[18px] w-[18px] transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 stroke-[2.5px]" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg> </span> </summary> <p class="mt-5 pr-4 sm:pr-16 text-base text-gray-600 leading-[1.85]"> Evet, tamamen ücretsiz, sınırsız, kayıt gereksiz. MIT açık kaynak. </p> </details><details class="group py-5 sm:py-8"> <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"> <span class="text-[16px] sm:text-[19px] font-bold text-gray-900"> Görsellerim bir sunucuya yükleniyor mu? </span> <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg transition-colors bg-gray-100 text-gray-400 group-open:bg-gray-950 group-open:text-white"> <svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-[18px] w-[18px] transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 stroke-[2.5px]" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg> </span> </summary> <p class="mt-5 pr-4 sm:pr-16 text-base text-gray-600 leading-[1.85]"> Hayır. Tamamı tarayıcıda yerel olarak işlenir. </p> </details><details class="group py-5 sm:py-8"> <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"> <span class="text-[16px] sm:text-[19px] font-bold text-gray-900"> Filigran kaldırma teknik olarak nasıl çalışıyor? </span> <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg transition-colors bg-gray-100 text-gray-400 group-open:bg-gray-950 group-open:text-white"> <svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-[18px] w-[18px] transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 stroke-[2.5px]" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg> </span> </summary> <p class="mt-5 pr-4 sm:pr-16 text-base text-gray-600 leading-[1.85]"> Reverse alpha blending orijinal pikselleri geri yükler, yapay zekâ boyaması değil. </p> </details><details class="group py-5 sm:py-8"> <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-6 list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"> <span class="text-[16px] sm:text-[19px] font-bold text-gray-900"> Nano Banana, yıldız kaplaması veya başka Gemini varyantlarında çalışır mı? </span> <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg transition-colors bg-gray-100 text-gray-400 group-open:bg-gray-950 group-open:text-white"> <svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-[18px] w-[18px] transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 stroke-[2.5px]" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg> </span> </summary> <p class="mt-5 pr-4 sm:pr-16 text-base text-gray-600 leading-[1.85]"> Evet. Logo, yıldız kaplaması ve Nano Banana desteklenir. Sorun mu var? GitHub&#39;̈da issue açın. </p> </details><detai