tify-between gap-6 list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"> <span class="text-[16px] sm:text-[19px] font-bold text-gray-900"> Her tür filigranı kaldırabilir mi? </span> <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg transition-colors bg-gray-100 text-gray-400 group-open:bg-gray-950 group-open:text-white"> <svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-[18px] w-[18px] transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 stroke-[2.5px]" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg> </span> </summary> <p class="mt-5 pr-4 sm:pr-16 text-base text-gray-600 leading-[1.85]"> Hayır. Yalnızca Gemini görünür filigranları. SynthID veya başka kaynaklar desteklenmez. </p> </details> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="relative py-16 sm:py-24 md:py-32 overflow-hidden" style="background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #091024 0%, #284c7e 45%, #6e9ed5 75%, #bedcf8 100%);"> <div class="container relative z-10 text-center"> <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl leading-tight"> Gemini filigranlarını<br>ücretsiz kaldırmaya hazır mısınız? </h2> <p class="mx-auto mt-4 sm:mt-5 max-w-xl text-base sm:text-lg text-white/70"> Açık kaynak, tarayıcı içinde yerel işlem, kayıt gerektirmez. Saniyeler içinde başlayın. </p> <div class="mt-8 sm:mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 px-4 sm:px-0"> <a href="#tool" class="inline-flex w-full sm:w-auto items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-gray-950 shadow-lg transition hover:bg-gray-100"> Filigranları şimdi kaldır <svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="ml-2 h-5 w-5" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"><